The legal text is the Constitution of Louisiana, Titles 12 and 14 of the Louisiana Revised Statutes and Civil Code articles 448 to 818 as published by the Louisiana State Legislature at https://legis.la.gov/. Statutes are not copyrightable (Georgia v. Public.Resource.Org, Inc., 590 U.S. 255 (2020)), and the site states no copyright claim. The text is republished unaltered in its wording, with credit to the Louisiana State Legislature as its publisher.

